Package: msrval
Title: Validation Harness for MultiScholaR Evidence Runs
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Ignatius", family = "Pang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ignatius.pang@mq.edu.au")
Description: Frozen inputs, declarations, the default-user driver, scoring,
    run-level intervals, classification, the licence guard and provenance
    shared by the MultiScholaR validation tickets. Evidence tooling only;
    never a MultiScholaR dependency and never distributed. The git tree hash
    of the harness folder is the version.
License: LGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: cli, checkmate, curl, digest, jsonlite, data.table, limma, edgeR,
    shiny, withr, processx, testthat, htmltools, xml2
Suggests: covr, pkgload, shinytest2, chromote
Config/testthat/edition: 3
